            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Snapbar 0.6</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Turn a recording's audio on or off in the editor: a new speaker button next to the keystrokes switch. Off mutes the preview and saves the video without sound.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
