            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Snapbar 0.4</h2>
<ul>
  <li>The smoothed cursor now moves evenly in exported recordings; it no longer stops and jumps when only the mouse is moving.</li>
  <li>New click indicator: a soft white circle that grows from the click and fades out.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
